  "notes": "{煮込|にこ}む means to simmer or stew food slowly, allowing flavors to blend thoroughly.\n\nCOMPOUND VERB:\n⟦{煮|に}る→煮る：01971_niru⟧ (to boil/cook) + ⟦{込|こ}む→込む：00719_komu⟧ (into, thoroughly) - the {込|こ}む adds the nuance of cooking deeply or for an extended time.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes を particle: ⟦カレー→カレー：02898_karee⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{煮込|にこ}む\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{弱火|よわび}→弱火：08168_yowabi⟧⟦で→で：00502_de⟧{煮込|にこ}む: to simmer over low heat\n- ⟦じっくり→じっくり：06252_jikkuri⟧{煮込|にこ}む: to simmer thoroughly\n- ⟦{味|あじ}→味：00826_aji⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦{染|し}みる→染みる：10354_shimiru⟧⟦まで→まで：00490_made⟧{煮込|にこ}む: to simmer until flavors soak in\n\nCOMMON DISHES:\n- ⟦{煮込|にこ}みうどん→煮込みうどん：noentry⟧: stewed udon\n- ⟦{煮込|にこ}みハンバーグ→煮込みハンバーグ：noentry⟧: hamburger steak in sauce\n- ⟦{牛|ぎゅう}{筋|すじ}→牛筋：noentry⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧{煮込|にこ}み: simmered beef tendon",
